me one of the best-selling Korean artists. Aside from group activities, he debuted as an actor in November 2010 in KBS2's drama special Pianist. He has since landed roles in television series such as Salamander Guru and The Shadows (2012), To the Beautiful You (2012), Medical Top Team (2013), My First Time (2015), and Hwarang: The Poet Warrior Youth (2016). He made his feature film debut in 2016 with Canola. As a soloist, he has released the digital singles \"I'm Home\" (2019) and \"Heartbreak\" (2021).","title":"Choi Min-ho","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Choi_Min-ho"}},"Q140073967":{"id":"Q140073967","name":"Kim Yoo Hyun","ko":"김유현","birthName":"","birthNameEn":"","aliases":["Leah","Chai"],"birth":"1996-07-25","death":"","birthplace":"Gwangyang","nationality":["South Korea"],"height":166,"occupations":["singer"],"debut":"","agencies":[],"groups":[{"id":"Q307478","name":"GP Basic","start":"","end":""},{"id":"Q127856633","name":"Ye-A","start":"","end":""}],"links":{"instagram":"https://www.instagram.com/oguogu._.mayo/"},"photo":null,"bio":null},"Q141030895":{"id":"Q141030895","name":"Yi Hani","ko":"","birthName":"","birthNameEn":"","aliases":[],"birth":"","death":"","birthplace":"","nationality":["United Kingdom"],"height":null,"occupations":["singer"],"debut":"2026","agencies":[],"groups":[{"id":"Q141030335","name":"Tuide","start":"","end":""}],"links":{},"photo":null,"bio":null},"Q16091631":{"id":"Q16091631","name":"Jeong Seok-won","ko":"정석원","birthName":"","birthNameEn":"","aliases":[],"birth":"1968-12-23","death":"","birthplace":"Daegu","nationality":["South Korea"],"height":null,"occupations":["record producer"],"debut":"","agencies":[{"name":"Mystic Story","korean":true,"id":"Q15509774","start":"","end":""}],"groups":[{"id":"Q12579912","name":"015B","start":"","end":""}],"links":{"musicbrainz":"https://musicbrainz.org/artist/94c80a22-0682-4ea8-a04c-9294a36ab474"},"photo":null,"bio":null},"Q16177775":{"id":"Q16177775","name":"Kang Tae-oh","ko":"강태오","birthName":"김윤환","birthNameEn":"","aliases":["Kim Yoon-hwan"],"birth":"1994-06-20","death":"","birthplace":"Incheon","nationality":["South Korea"],"height":null,"occupations":["singer","film actor","television actor","actor"],"debut":"2013","agencies":[],"groups":[{"id":"Q16935427","name":"5urprise","start":"","end":""}],"links":{"instagram":"https://www.instagram.com/kto940620/"},"photo":{"url":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/9/9b/%EA%B0%95%ED%83%9C%EC%98%A4_2021_%281%29.png?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail_unscaled","page":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:%EA%B0%95%ED%83%9C%EC%98%A4_2021_(1).png","author":"Marie Claire Korea","license":"CC BY 3.0"},"bio":{"text":"Kim Yoon-hwan, known professionally as Kang Tae-oh is a South Korean actor and singer. He was a member of the actor group 5urprise. He rose to international popularity for his starring role in the television series Extraordinary Attorney Woo (2022).","title":"Kang Tae-oh","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Kang_Tae-oh"}},"Q16767663":{"id":"Q16767663","name":"Ellin","ko":"엘린","birthName":"","birthNameEn":"","aliases":["Kim Min-young"],"birth":"1990-04-02","death":"","birthplace":"Seoul","nationality":["South Korea"],"height":null,"occupations":["singer"],"debut":"2012","agencies":[],"groups":[{"id":"Q60157","name":"Crayon Pop","start":"","end":""}],"links":{"instagram":"https://www.instagram.com/hiellin/","youtube":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UC1hfB2wB4uU23FgaUtZpYeg","musicbrainz":"https://musicbrainz.org/artist/dbef3c93-0812-4fce-b367-0ad95ce7aa58"},"photo":null,"bio":null},"Q22128111":{"id":"Q22128111","name":"Yua Mikami","ko":"미카미 유아","birthName":"","birthNameEn":"","aliases":["Momona Kito","Mikami Yua"],"birth":"1993-08-16","death":"","birthplace":"Nagoya","nationality":["Japan"],"height":159,"occupations":["Japanese idol","AV actress","VTuber"],"debut":"2009","agencies":[],"groups":[{"id":"Q50821732","name":"Honey Popcorn","start":"","end":""}],"links":{"website":"https://miss.co.jp/","instagram":"https://www.instagram.com/yua_mikami/","x":"https://x.com/yua_mikami","youtube":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UC0BCfHbNORhd7dsw1R5rw9w","tiktok":"https://www.tiktok.com/@yua_mikami","musicbrainz":"https://musicbrainz.org/artist/a66eff6c-5553-4eab-b561-813ff0447cea"},"photo":null,"bio":{"text":"Momona Kitō, known professionally as Yua Mikami (Japanese: 三上 悠亜, Hepburn: Mikami Yua), is a Japanese singer, YouTuber, and former adult video and film actress. She debuted as a member of the idol group SKE48 in 2009 before leaving in 2014. She entered the adult entertainment industry in 2015 under the Muteki label and became one of the most popular and best-selling contemporary AV idols, winning several awards in the process. Mikami performed under the S1 No. 1 Style label and has appeared in over 200 adult films (including compilations and VR-based AVs as well).","title":"Yua Mikami","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Yua_Mikami"}},"Q24000111":{"id":"Q24000111","name":"Yoo Hyun-jae","ko":"유현재","birthName":"","birthNameEn":"","aliases":[],"birth":"1973-06-06","death":"","birthplace":"Incheon","nationality":["South Korea"],"height":null,"occupations":["singer"],"debut":"","agencies":[],"groups":[{"id":"Q12621310","name":"Two Two","start":"","end":""}],"links":{},"photo":null,"bio":null},"Q263279":{"id":"Q263279","name":"Hyomin","ko":"효민","birthName":"박선영","birthNameEn":"","aliases":["Hyo Min","Hyo-min","Park Sun-young","Bak Seon-yeong"],"birth":"1989-05-30","death":"","birthplace":"Busan","nationality":["South Korea"],"height":null,"occupations":["singer","actor"],"debut":"2009","agencies":[{"name":"MBK Entertainment","korean":true,"id":"Q429296","start":"","end":""}],"groups":[{"id":"Q495383","name":"T-ara","start":"","end":""}],"links":{"instagram":"https://www.instagram.com/hyominnn/","x":"https://x.com/b89530","musicbrainz":"https://musicbrainz.org/artist/c32e5c67-88f9-4111-b94c-ba28a36ea074"},"photo":null,"bio":{"text":"Park Sun-young, known professionally as Hyomin (효민), is a South Korean singer, actress, businesswoman, and creative director, known for her work as a member of South Korean girl group T-ara. Apart from her group's activities, Hyomin has also starred in various television dramas such as My Girlfriend is a Nine-Tailed Fox, and Gyebaek, and in various films such as Ghastly and Jinx!!!. She debuted as a solo artist with her debut mini-album, Make Up, on June 30, 2014, with the lead track \"Nice Body\" which earned her three nominations at the Seoul Music Awards. Since then, she has released two EPs: Sketch (2016) and Allure (2019).","title":"Hyomin","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Hyomin"}},"Q30311663":{"id":"Q30311663","name":"Kim Jae Hwan","ko":"김재환","birthName":"","birthNameEn":"","aliases":["Kim Jae-Hwan"],"birth":"1996-05-27","death":"","birthplace":"Seoul","nationality":["South Korea"],"height":null,"occupations":["singer"],"debut":"2017","agencies":[],"groups":[{"id":"Q30311578","name":"Wanna One","start":"2017","end":"2019"}],"links":{"instagram":"https://www.instagram.com/jaehwan0527/","x":"https://x.com/KJH_officialtwt","musicbrainz":"https://musicbrainz.org/artist/174fe0a5-2861-44d0-8bb8-0f6d639b91ef"},"photo":{"url":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/e/e1/Kim_Jae-hwan_in_2019.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail_unscaled","page":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Kim_Jae-hwan_in_2019.jpg","author":"디스패치","license":"CC BY 3.0"},"bio":{"text":"Kim Jae-hwan, known mononymously as Jaehwan (재환), is a South Korean singer-songwriter, known for finishing fourth in Produce 101 (season 2). He is a former member of the South Korean boy group Wanna One. As the group promoted for a year and a half, it achieved both critical and commercial success with all four of its albums topping South Korea's Gaon Album Chart and all five of its lead singles ranking in the top three of South Korea's Gaon Digital Chart. Kim debuted as a soloist with his first extended play, Another, which was released on May 20, 2019.","title":"Kim Jae-hwan (singer)","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Kim_Jae-hwan_%28singer%29"}},"Q38571183":{"id":"Q38571183","name":"Jang Ye-eun","ko":"장예은","birthName":"","birthNameEn":"","aliases":["Yeeun","Jang Yeeun","Ye-eun"],"birth":"1998-08-10","death":"","birthplace":"Dongducheon","nationality":["South Korea"],"height":null,"occupations":["singer","composer","film actor","rapper"],"debut":"2015","agencies":[],"groups":[{"id":"Q19626731","name":"CLC","start":"2015","end":"2022"}],"links":{"website":"https://yeeun.bstage.in/","instagram":"https://www.instagram.com/yyyyeeun/","tiktok":"https://www.tiktok.com/@yeeun810","spotify":"https://open.spotify.com/artist/4hMhbcPHd2nsZFhY1TNp8Y","musicbrainz":"https://musicbrainz.org/artist/2e57b58e-3da5-4ab5-828f-24ac1cb20928"},"photo":null,"bio":{"text":"Jang Ye-eun, better known as Yeeun, is a South Korean singer, songwriter, and rapper signed to Superbell Company. She is best known as the main rapper of the South Korean girl group CLC. She was part of the longest-running pair of hosts at SBS MTV's The Show, hosting from May 2018 to November 2019, alongside Jeno of NCT Dream.","title":"Jang Ye-eun","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Jang_Ye-eun"}},"Q464623":{"id":"Q464623","name":"Krystal Jung","ko":"정수정","birthName":"","birthNameEn":"","aliases":["Chrystal So Jung","Krystal Jong"],"birth":"1994-10-24","death":"","birthplace":"San Francisco","nationality":["United States","South Korea"],"height":null,"occupations":["singer","actor","model","film actor","dancer"],"debut":"2009","agencies":[{"name":"SM Entertainment","korean":true,"id":"Q483938","start":"","end":""}],"groups":[{"id":"Q344286","name":"f(x)","start":"","end":""}],"links":{"instagram":"https://www.instagram.com/vousmevoyez/","musicbrainz":"https://musicbrainz.org/artist/6b4b579d-b9cb-44c3-846d-8f6b64413902"},"photo":null,"bio":{"text":"Chrystal Soo Jung, known professionally as Krystal Jung, is an American and South Korean singer and actress. She debuted in 2009 as a member of the South Korean girl group f(x) and has further participated in SM Entertainment's project group SM the Ballad. Aside from group activities, she has also acted in various South Korean drama series such as The Heirs (2013), My Lovely Girl (2014), Prison Playbook (2017), The Bride of Habaek (2017), Player (2018), Search (2020), Police University (2021), and Crazy Love (2022).","title":"Krystal Jung","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Krystal_Jung"}},"Q482991":{"id":"Q482991","name":"Taeyang","ko":"태양","birthName":"동영배","birthNameEn":"","aliases":["Dong Young-bae","Sol (Taeyang)"],"birth":"1988-05-18","death":"","birthplace":"Uijeongbu","nationality":["South Korea"],"height":null,"occupations":["singer","composer","dancer","pop singer"],"debut":"2006","agencies":[{"name":"YG Entertainment","korean":true,"id":"Q50595","start":"","end":""},{"name":"Avex Group","korean":false,"id":"Q790686","start":"","end":""}],"groups":[{"id":"Q282104","name":"BigBang","start":"","end":""},{"id":"Q20943943","name":"GD X Taeyang","start":"","end":""}],"links":{"instagram":"https://www.instagram.com/__youngbae__/","x":"https://x.com/Realtaeyang","youtube":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCDJnRpq0DnQhrwi1ruuQa7g","spotify":"https://open.spotify.com/artist/6udveWUgX4vu75FF0DTrXV","musicbrainz":"https://musicbrainz.org/artist/d84e5667-3cbe-4556-b551-9d7e4be95d71"},"photo":null,"bio":{"text":"Dong Young-bae, better known by his stage name Taeyang (태양; lit. 'sun') or SOL, is a South Korean singer and songwriter. He made his debut in 2006 as a member of the South Korean boy band BigBang. Following the release of several albums and extended plays with his group, Taeyang pursued a solo career in 2008, releasing his first extended play, Hot. The EP was acclaimed by critics and went to win the award for Best R&B & Soul Album at the 6th Korean Music Awards. Hot was followed by his first full-length studio album Solar (2010), which was released in July 2010 and peaked atop the Gaon Album Chart.","title":"Taeyang","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Taeyang"}},"Q57598831":{"id":"Q57598831","name":"T.K","ko":"T.K (가수)","birthName":"이민우","birthNameEn":"","aliases":["Lee Min-woo"],"birth":"1995-12-20","death":"","birthplace":"","nationality":[],"height":null,"occupations":["rapper"],"debut":"","agencies":[],"groups":[{"id":"Q491944","name":"C-Clown","start":"","end":""}],"links":{"instagram":"https://www.instagram.com/1220mm/"},"photo":null,"bio":null},"Q57601775":{"id":"Q57601775","name":"Hyunjin","ko":"현진","birthName":"황현진","birthNameEn":"","aliases":["Hwang Hyun-jin"],"birth":"2000-03-20","death":"","birthplace":"Seoul","nationality":["South Korea"],"height":null,"occupations":["rapper","singer","dancer","composer","actor","musician"],"debut":"2017","agencies":[{"name":"JYP Entertainment","korean":true,"id":"Q483238","start":"","end":""}],"groups":[{"id":"Q46134670","name":"Stray Kids","start":"","end":""}],"links":{"instagram":"https://www.instagram.com/hynjinnnn/","musicbrainz":"https://musicbrainz.org/artist/459b84e0-2636-45e3-96c8-af114dfbd9be"},"photo":null,"bio":{"text":"Hwang Hyun-jin, known mononymously as Hyunjin, is a South Korean rapper, dancer, and singer. He is a member of the South Korean boy band Stray Kids, formed by JYP Entertainment in 2017. Aside from his work with Stray Kids, he has worked as a television presenter, hosting the weekly Korean music program Show! Music Core (2019–2021), and has worked as a brand ambassador for luxury brands, such as Versace, Cartier, Givenchy Beauty, and Guess.","title":"Hyunjin (Stray Kids singer)","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Hyunjin_%28Stray_Kids_singer%29"}},"Q626991":{"id":"Q626991","name":"Lee Jaijin","ko":"이재진","birthName":"","birthNameEn":"","aliases":["Lee Jae Jin","Lee Jae-Jin","Lee Jae-jin","Lee Jai-jin"],"birth":"1979-07-18","death":"",